<p>NOTE: A. During the second quarter of 1996, the company recorded a $1.1 billion charge relating to unasserted asbestos personal injury claims that may be received after 1999 and a probable $225 million recovery from excess level non-products insurance carriers, having a combined after tax impact of $542 million.  The current portion of the reserve for asbestos litigation claims, net of insurance, is $200 million. The total reserve, net of insurance, is $1,361 million.</p>
